OL,3,GNEWSAMore than #40k raised for station
OL,4,Acat's vet bills
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #40,000 has been raised to
OL,7,Fhelp pay for a popular railway station
OL,8,Fcat's vet bills after he suddenly fell
OL,9,Fill.
OL,11,FGeorge, the Stourbridge Junction cat,
OL,12,Fwas receiving treatment and had spent
OL,13,Fthe night at a veterinary clinic after
OL,14,Fbecoming "very poorly", a post on
OL,15,FFacebook said on Monday.
OL,17,FThe beloved ginger-and-white feline
OL,18,Fbecame an online sensation for
OL,19,Fregularly hanging around the station,
OL,20,Famassing more than 260,000 followers
OL,21,Facross various social media platforms.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
