OL,3,GNEWSAMore than #40k raised for station
OL,4,Acat's vet bills
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an update Simone Carter - his very
OL,7,Fown social media manager - said George
OL,8,Fhad been placed on a drip and was
OL,9,Fundergoing scans to find out what was
OL,10,Fwrong.
